%%{init: {"flowchart": {"rankSpacing": 28, "nodeSpacing": 18, "padding": 6}}}%%
flowchart LR
  accTitle: A request and its possible outcomes
  accDescr: A Slack message reaches the clone, which judges it. While Require my approval is on, its reply and any work it would start wait on Home for your OK, and a declined one sends and starts nothing. The clone judges the message as a refused request, a question, your own change to a service, research or work. A refusal ends with what the person's side needs. A question ends with an answer, or goes to you when the asker may not ask for work. Your own change is made, and anyone else's changes nothing. Research ends with an answer or a blocked report, and a confirmed problem goes on as work. Work goes to a worker per independent part and ends with an open pull request, a merge where workers may merge, or a result in the thread, and it can wait on something missing, stop, be blocked by a sign-in or access, or ask you one short question. The numbered list under the diagram describes every path.

  msg["1. A Slack message"]:::start
  judge["2. The clone judges it"]:::start

  msg --> judge

  judge -->|"Require my approval on"| held["Waits on Home for your OK"]:::conditional
  held -->|"declined"| declined["Nothing goes out or starts"]:::stop

  judge --> refused["3. Staging, production, a release, or others' work without approval"]:::path
  judge --> question["4. A question"]:::path
  judge --> own["5. Your own change to a service"]:::path
  judge --> research["6. Research"]:::path
  judge --> work["7. Work, a worker per independent part"]:::path

  refused --> said["Refused, or what their side needs"]:::stop

  question --> answer["A marked answer"]:::result
  question --> passed["The rest goes to you"]:::decision

  own --> changed["Made, and said what changed"]:::result
  own -->|"someone else"| unchanged["Nothing changes, passed to you"]:::stop

  research --> report["An answer, with sources"]:::result
  research --> blocked["Blocked: a sign-in or access"]:::stop
  research -->|"confirmed"| goes["Goes on as work (7)"]:::conditional

  work --> pr["An open pull request"]:::result
  work --> merged["Merged, where workers may merge"]:::conditional
  work --> done["A result in the thread"]:::result
  work --> waits["A step waits, the rest goes on"]:::wait
  work --> stops["Stopped, or failed twice"]:::stop
  work --> blockedwork["Blocked: a sign-in"]:::stop
  work --> ask["One short question to you"]:::decision

  classDef start fill:#ffcf4a,stroke:#1f1b16,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f1b16,font-weight:bold
  classDef path fill:#fff7da,stroke:#1f1b16,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f1b16,font-weight:bold
  classDef result fill:#d9f0f2,stroke:#0b6a77,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f1b16
  classDef wait fill:#ffdcc0,stroke:#8a3d00,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f1b16
  classDef stop fill:#fbd5ce,stroke:#a82a1a,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f1b16
  classDef decision fill:#ffeeb0,stroke:#1f1b16,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f1b16
  classDef conditional fill:#ffffff,stroke:#1f1b16,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#1f1b16
